{"1653020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crude Oil", "steam_appid": 1653020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a blob of oil and you have to escape from the oil industry.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/52be4e3abea50c25e2a9a838fa64d27f.poster.avif?t=1782428303\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/52be4e3abea50c25e2a9a838fa64d27f.webm?t=1782428303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/52be4e3abea50c25e2a9a838fa64d27f.mp4?t=1782428303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bounce Around</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splat off the walls, bowl thru stacks of barrels, and skate across puddles as an elastic blob, with Mario-like moves subverted by formlessness. Slow time to pull a tricky maneuver, or just to savor your character’s outlandish acrobatics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/89f716c4e6cea81ec48c034462e6ae34.poster.avif?t=1782428303\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/89f716c4e6cea81ec48c034462e6ae34.webm?t=1782428303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/89f716c4e6cea81ec48c034462e6ae34.mp4?t=1782428303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Huge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and launch oil droplets to grow into a formidable glob or shrink to a modest slick. Try on different hats for a variety of short-term power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b5213da178802367b8004705d9cf1938.poster.avif?t=1782428303\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b5213da178802367b8004705d9cf1938.webm?t=1782428303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b5213da178802367b8004705d9cf1938.mp4?t=1782428303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a forklift to lift and stack heavy obstacles to suit your oily needs. Mix it up with rude robots.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b55c2dba431c0ef6ee8f7f7d2db9bfd4.poster.avif?t=1782428303\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b55c2dba431c0ef6ee8f7f7d2db9bfd4.webm?t=1782428303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b55c2dba431c0ef6ee8f7f7d2db9bfd4.mp4?t=1782428303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALSO:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OST by Body Meat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle-able CRT and 4:3 display modes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and collect hidden pinecones in a seamless open world</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a blob of oil and you have to escape from the oil industry.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/52be4e3abea50c25e2a9a838fa64d27f.poster.avif?t=1782428303\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/52be4e3abea50c25e2a9a838fa64d27f.webm?t=1782428303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/52be4e3abea50c25e2a9a838fa64d27f.mp4?t=1782428303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bounce Around</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splat off the walls, bowl thru stacks of barrels, and skate across puddles as an elastic blob, with Mario-like moves subverted by formlessness. Slow time to pull a tricky maneuver, or just to savor your character’s outlandish acrobatics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/89f716c4e6cea81ec48c034462e6ae34.poster.avif?t=1782428303\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/89f716c4e6cea81ec48c034462e6ae34.webm?t=1782428303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/89f716c4e6cea81ec48c034462e6ae34.mp4?t=1782428303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Huge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and launch oil droplets to grow into a formidable glob or shrink to a modest slick. Try on different hats for a variety of short-term power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b5213da178802367b8004705d9cf1938.poster.avif?t=1782428303\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b5213da178802367b8004705d9cf1938.webm?t=1782428303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b5213da178802367b8004705d9cf1938.mp4?t=1782428303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a forklift to lift and stack heavy obstacles to suit your oily needs. Mix it up with rude robots.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b55c2dba431c0ef6ee8f7f7d2db9bfd4.poster.avif?t=1782428303\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b55c2dba431c0ef6ee8f7f7d2db9bfd4.webm?t=1782428303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/extras/b55c2dba431c0ef6ee8f7f7d2db9bfd4.mp4?t=1782428303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALSO:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OST by Body Meat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle-able CRT and 4:3 display modes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and collect hidden pinecones in a seamless open world</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Escape your captors as a puddle of petroleum on the run from Big Oil. Collect more oil to grow big and juicy. Bounce and slide. Operate heavy machinery. Flush polluters down the drain.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653020/463b43b32eb6a6671fdafa4abd5b1162